<!DOCTYPE html>
<head>
    <title>Sticky Navigation and Card Overlay</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #7f8287;
            color: #333;
        }

        nav {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;

            background-color: #2563eb;
            padding: 18px 30px;
            color: white;
        }

        nav h2 {
            display: inline-block;
        }

        nav ul {
            float: right;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav ul li {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-left: 25px;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: #dbeafe;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 10px auto;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #1e40af;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .intro {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .card {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 400px;
            margin: auto;
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 220px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        .badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            right: 10px;

            background-color: #ef4444;
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .card-content {
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .card-content h2 {
            color: #1e40af;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card-content p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #1e40af;
        }

        .extra-content {
            margin-top: 10px;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .extra-content h2 {
            color: #1e40af;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .extra-content p {
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #1e40af;
            color: white;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            nav {
                padding: 15px;
            }

            nav h2 {
                display: block;
                text-align: center;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
            }

            nav ul {
                float: none;
                text-align: center;
            }

            nav ul li {
                margin: 0 8px;
            }

            .container {
                margin: 20px auto;
                padding: 15px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <nav>
        <h2>My Website</h2>

        <ul>
            <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="container" id="home">

        <h1>Sticky Navigation & Card Overlay</h1>

        <p class="intro">
            This webpage demonstrates a sticky navigation bar
            and a card with an overlay badge using CSS positioning.
        </p>

        <div class="card">

            <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72"
                alt="Modern office workspace"
            >

            <span class="badge">Featured</span>

            <div class="card-content">
                <h2>Modern Workspace</h2>

                <p>
                    Discover a beautiful and modern workspace
                    designed for creativity and productivity.
                </p>

                <a href="#" class="btn">Read More</a>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="extra-content" id="about">

            <h2>About This Website</h2>

            <p>
                This website uses CSS positioning techniques.
                The navigation bar uses position: sticky to
                remain visible while scrolling.
            </p>

            <p>
                The card uses position: relative, while the
                featured badge uses position: absolute to
                appear over the image.
            </p>

            <p>
                CSS properties such as margin, padding,
                border-radius, box-shadow and z-index are
                used to improve the design.
            </p>

            <h2 id="contact">Contact Us</h2>

            <p>
                Email: yuggupta1990@email.com
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>©️ 2026 My Website. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
